---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Contact | Rutledge Digital" description="Start a conversation about your website project with Rutledge Digital.">
  <section class="page-hero section-pad"><div class="container narrow"><p class="eyebrow">Contact</p><h1>Let's talk about<br /><span>what comes next.</span></h1><p class="hero-lede">Tell me a little about your business and what you'd like your website to do. I'll follow up to discuss goals, options, and next steps.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section-pad page-content"><div class="container contact-grid"><div class="contact-copy"><p class="eyebrow">Start a conversation</p><h2>Good projects start<br />with a clear brief.</h2><p>Share as much or as little as you know right now. You don't need a finished plan to get started.</p><div class="contact-detail"><span class="contact-symbol">↗</span><div><b>Email</b><p>Replace this with your business email before launch.</p></div></div><div class="contact-detail"><span class="contact-symbol">◎</span><div><b>What happens next?</b><p>We'll talk through your goals, timing, budget, and what a sensible first step looks like.</p></div></div></div>
    <form class="contact-form" action="mailto:erikrutledge.com" method="post" enctype="text/plain">
      <label for="name">Your name</label><input id="name" name="Name" autocomplete="name" required />
      <label for="email">Email address</label><input id="email" name="Email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required />
      <label for="business">Business or website (optional)</label><input id="business" name="Business or website" autocomplete="url" />
      <label for="project">What do you need help with?</label><select id="project" name="Project type"><option>New website</option><option>Redesign</option><option>Maintenance and updates</option><option>E-commerce</option><option>Not sure yet</option></select>
      <label for="message">Tell me about your project</label><textarea id="message" name="Message" rows="5" required></textarea>
      <button class="button" type="submit">Prepare email <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button>
      <p class="form-fineprint">This starter uses an email-client handoff, not a secure form-processing service. Don't collect sensitive information here.</p>
    </form>
  </div></section>
</BaseLayout>
